<name>(2) Right and down to park at Fife Coastal Path start</name>
<desc>In just over 500 m, veer off the pavement on Abernethy Road into a public car-park where there is a plaque marking the start of the Fife Coastal Path. Take the steps down to the park and follow the Coastal Path as it goes right and gently downhill, around the edge of the park.</desc>
