<name>(4) Divert right to Lindores Abbey-Distillery</name>
<desc>Eventually, after 1.8 km, the path meets the C46 Abbey Road. Turn right here to walk along the edge of the road, heading towards the Lindores Abbey ruins on your right side and the Lindores Distillery on your left side.  (2.7 km)</desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
<extensions>
<xstyle:fill>
<xstyle:color>ff0000</xstyle:color>
